{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102230","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1310223001:0":{"text":"우와, 정말 특별한 걸 만드셨네요! 당신은 누구시죠?","source_cn":"哇，你的造型好别致，你是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDCE53DF405EFFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310223002:0":{"text":"그야 물론 눈사람 만들기 종목을 맡은 사무원이죠. 어때요? 올해 저희 스태프 복장 너무 귀엽지 않나요?","source_cn":"当然是负责堆雪人项目的办事员啦。怎么样，今年我们这些工...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDCC1979E71166D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310223003:0":{"text":"네, 네! 정말 재미있는 스타일이네요!","source_cn":"嗯嗯，很有趣的造型呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x017E37B69AF4A9F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310223004:0":{"text":"이게 여러분이 만든 눈사람인가요? 좋네요, 아주 좋아요! 정확하게 말하자면, 오늘 본 눈사람 중 가장 멋있어요!","source_cn":"这是你们堆的雪人？不错，真不错！确切地说，是我今天见过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C4D88AF6E0CF76F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310223005:0":{"text":"여러분은 진짜 꽃잎을 받을 자격이 있어요!","source_cn":"你们值得一片真正的花瓣！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38F711FED30945F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310223006:1":{"text":"와! 잘 됐네요!","source_cn":"哇！太好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA85E658F8195306","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祭典办事员":{"text":"축제 직원","source":"祭典办事员","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}